    "Public beta follows listing. V1 covers send, receive, swap, the fiat payout rails and staking from inside the app. Merchant tools and the payment API come in the release after that.": `Beta publik menyusul listing. V1 mencakup kirim, terima, swap, jalur payout fiat, dan staking dari dalam aplikasi. Alat merchant dan API pembayaran datang di rilis berikutnya.`,
