    Presale: `预售`,
    "Presale allocations unlock in full at listing — no cliff, no drip. Team and treasury allocations vest linearly over 24 months from listing, with the schedule written into the contract.": `预售分配在上市时全部解锁 — 无悬崖期、无分期释放。团队与金库分配自上市起24个月内线性归属，时间表写入合约。`,
