    "Public beta follows listing. V1 covers send, receive, swap, the fiat payout rails and staking from inside the app. Merchant tools and the payment API come in the release after that.": `公开测试版在上市之后。V1涵盖发送、接收、兑换、法币出金通道以及应用内质押。商户工具与支付API在后续版本推出。`,
