    "Remittix Earn introduced": `Remittix Earn已引入`,
    "Remittix is built as a full ecosystem, not a single feature. Pay, trade, stake and store from the same wallet, on the same rails that move crypto into any bank account.": `Remittix是完整生态系统，而非单一功能。在同一钱包中支付、交易、质押与存储，基于将加密货币转入任意银行账户的同一套轨道。`,
    "Remittix made sending crypto directly to my bank account surprisingly fast and simple, with no confusing steps or hidden hassle.": `Remittix让把加密货币直接打入银行账户变得出奇地快速简单，没有令人困惑的步骤或隐性麻烦。`,
    "Remittix Mystery Boxes are here — discover exclusive RTX rewards, bonuses and prizes inside.": `Remittix神秘盒子已上线 — 发现专属RTX奖励、加成与奖品。`,
    "Remittix operates just like your favorite banking apps, but we allow you to send crypto while ensuring your recipients receive fiat. When you need an easy solution for crypto payments, Remittix is your go-to protocol.": `Remittix的操作体验与您喜爱的银行应用一样，但您可以发送加密货币，同时确保收款人收到法币。当您需要简单的加密支付方案时，Remittix就是您的首选协议。`,
    "Remittix takes the complexity out of crypto payments and makes sending money feel as simple as a regular bank transfer.": `Remittix去掉了加密支付的复杂性，让汇款感觉像普通银行转账一样简单。`,
