    "Self-custody by default. Your keys never leave your device, with hardware wallet support and a built-in vault for long-term holdings.": `默认自我托管。您的密钥永不离开设备，支持硬件钱包，并内置长期持有金库。`,
    "Send crypto payments straight to bank accounts in over 30 currencies— simply connect your wallet.": `以超过30种货币将加密支付直接打入银行账户— 只需连接钱包。`,
    "Send crypto, they receive fiat. Local payment rails in over 30 currencies with same-day settlement and zero FX fees, straight into any bank account.": `您发送加密货币，对方收到法币。超过30种货币的本地支付通道，当日结算、零外汇手续费，直达任意银行账户。`,
